I get the same assertion failure from this (python 3.7.5, mypy version `0.770+dev.35b50397cabd36066d2dd92b979794b94f1741d3` -- i.e. git master as of today):

```
from dataclasses import dataclass, field

@dataclass
class Base:
    foo: bool = field(default=False, init=False)

@dataclass
class Derived(Base):
    @property
    def foo(self):
        pass
```
